<title>USA: TABLE - QUIDEL Corp Q1 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - QUIDEL Corp Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>QUIDEL Corporation</p>
<p>		 Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>		For the three months ended June 30,</p>
<p> (In thousands, except per share data)  FY 1997	 FY 1996</p>
<p> Net sales					$8,747	   $9,047</p>
<p>  Research contracts and royalties	   622		665</p>
<p>  Total revenues				 9,369	    9,712</p>
<p> Gross profit				    4,030	    4,777</p>
<p> As a percentage of sales			46%		53%</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p>  Research and development		   1,747	    1,732</p>
<p>  Sales and marketing			  2,543	    2,607</p>
<p>  General and administrative		 1,157		816</p>
<p>   Total operating expenses		  5,447	    5,155</p>
<p>  Net income (loss)			    (791)		193</p>
<p>  Net income (loss) per share		(.03)		.01</p>
<p>  Shares used in per share calculation  23,552	   22,962</p>
